            <div xml:id="m-61722c1e-cd5f-4be4-8814-64ecdc0006fb">
              <lg xml:id="m-3ed33619-bbe0-44c5-886d-711c8c849edf">
                <l xml:id="m-a49c05ba-545f-4e16-bafa-b8fba05354e6" facs="#m-35d37ccc-d874-4051-9dc7-627f8a789e0b" label="text-like">1200 Common of a Confessor not a Bishop. Mass I.</l><l xml:id="m-d4dc86a8-94c1-4aed-9f2a-2deb13f8204a" facs="#m-3609d42a-ef27-4ddc-b532-a63ab1e1e9b2" label="text-like">Another Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-8d8bd159-c35f-42a4-909d-3c4f98ec4060" facs="#m-e6e799fc-db40-444b-a8b4-d571a9ae60f7" label="lyrics-like">TDésto Dómine supplicatiónibus ut qui nostrae justitiae fidúciam</l><l xml:id="m-54bd410d-7fb4-4b62-b6a5-b91e65430598" facs="#m-a37959b1-e30a-4e90-97ae-a58fe7c41e24" label="lyrics-like">A nostris, quas in beáti N. Con-non habémus,* ejus qui tibi plácuit</l><l xml:id="m-e023ccb4-622d-4916-8b3a-5f78874b4146" facs="#m-356968af-cc8e-45ff-b6ac-83dc5cce7926" label="lyrics-like">fessóris tui solemnitáte deférimus:t l précibus adjuvémur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9fa40611-98da-4802-9f85-53fd774fb476" facs="#m-95541bee-afd6-49d8-a2a5-40a7d80c2e98" label="lyrics-like">For an Abbot, the Prayer Intercéssio. p. 1206, is said.</l><l xml:id="m-42aeb636-20a6-420e-847f-7c5bd1db21d7" facs="#m-2d9342b9-51ef-4cbc-8961-94c41e0f8728" label="text-like">If a Commemoration is to be made from another Office which has the</l><l xml:id="m-556065cc-d0f2-46ae-8167-60cb7bf8ea0a" facs="#m-e94d215b-1a60-4221-9a01-9006702af805" label="text-like">same Antiphon as the foregoing. the following Antiphon is said for the</l><l xml:id="m-660c725e-09a3-44f4-a1fb-004baaae4636" facs="#m-bbf56a48-1f13-41b6-9e05-a7426693c0f1" label="ambiguous">Commemoration.</l><l xml:id="m-6070557d-2339-4466-9dd2-e1d3865413a8" facs="#m-2d1c72a6-83a3-4115-aa22-9d47dca30600" label="ambiguous">Ant. E</l><l xml:id="m-de38f705-27c3-4be2-a016-b538fafa3460" facs="#m-d1b83cf7-57ea-4947-b5d0-9aeb37af0c3d" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-42ffbc13-5754-4b29-871d-80876e5544f3" facs="#m-a6c658ef-59ef-460a-ba9b-7ffca6c505b6" label="lyrics-like">U- ge“sérve bóne et fi-dé-lis, qui-a in páuca</l><l xml:id="m-69ecda33-e708-41bd-9a25-959e983b4e64" facs="#m-e3ca2660-5c94-4a2f-886e-d6f4fcd4ffb8" label="lyrics-like">fu-isti fi-dé-lis, supra múlta te constí-tu-am: intra in</l><l xml:id="m-0f6ab6f0-6124-4301-b709-22567c6b3261" facs="#m-af3a9048-2a43-4f46-8a66-c6a51d05aa85" label="lyrics-like">gáudi-um Dómimni tú-i T. P. Alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-acc497b9-ff66-4821-8e1f-fbd84fbf294e" facs="#m-0dd33495-d2d2-422f-ae56-19cc4333f971" label="lyrics-like">V. Jústum dedúxit. p. 1199. 1f this Y. has already been said, it is</l><l xml:id="m-b225bca7-c349-4ecc-bfd2-5944cc687917" facs="#m-add53a0d-c05b-4dc4-827b-75b37a61c1c0" label="text-like">here replaced by the following:</l><l xml:id="m-15914961-a37f-49d3-a2a0-6dcda3aae126" facs="#m-eef61bdf-bafa-4ca9-90de-33eced33fd0b" label="lyrics-like">V. Os jústi meditábitur sapiéntiam. (T. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-61d5968a-bc6b-4a74-9fb8-c3a2db672b08" facs="#m-403f32ea-37f9-4ee5-9800-f434c21a2904" label="lyrics-like">K. Et lingua éjus loquétur judícium. (T. P. Alleluia.)</l><l xml:id="m-a8e963d3-bcfc-4bad-a524-87613d68d7a8" facs="#m-5dcb9922-d360-4687-b907-62d3432a1261" label="text-like">Compline of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-1752d02e-567f-4e37-86b6-588c0fcc751d" facs="#m-c8680b78-0254-4a4e-9ed6-f2a38ef6fa64" label="text-like">If a Feast be celebrated of two or more Confessors not Bishons, the</l><l xml:id="m-e37f6888-446e-4baf-b3fa-041767f3bec5" facs="#m-19a7933e-cffd-484a-9a86-e47ddca9cc07" label="text-like">foregoing Ofice is said; but in the Prayer, words in the singular are changed</l><l xml:id="m-777e99db-0d53-4799-b8cf-b7e5ec3e5621" facs="#m-7bd1b0e1-65d6-4ea0-be68-22c8a168434b" label="text-like">into the plural wherever necessary.</l><l xml:id="m-cb6cc37c-be88-4271-bd20-fa0c0a9fc908" facs="#m-c3736587-0321-4b58-a1af-723078c9af96" label="text-like">L. MASS OF A CONFESSOR NOT A BISHOP.</l><l xml:id="m-7f64e2ac-9d88-4ab1-96fd-742bd5b32f5d" facs="#m-5111bf2d-e757-41d2-9b76-3ebcb5c28a5d" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-0728f0ef-dfb0-409f-85c2-142238ad6d99" facs="#m-a21e3633-273a-4f6b-b6ce-41a28a73187d" label="lyrics-like">US jú- sti “ medi- tá- bi-tur sapi- énti¬ am,</l><l xml:id="m-7df22a71-7b42-46b9-af4d-3aa14010e98b" facs="#m-28b408e7-9e78-4ccb-881d-c108ba5ff7dd" label="lyrics-like">et língua é¬ jus loqué-tur judí¬ci¬</l><l xml:id="m-4cf4b78c-eff7-4eb1-a7a2-eee531959e22" facs="#m-fe273084-aaa9-48d4-bc9a-6bb1e44cdd57" label="lyrics-like">um: lex Dé-i</l><l xml:id="m-5191b379-e46a-4306-b145-dd23c2abd2a2" facs="#m-10e8847a-4193-4b15-ad50-765725ede288" label="lyrics-like">é-jus</l><l xml:id="m-a83dbc9c-1649-456d-b519-57f7af8c2a94" facs="#m-266865c9-9a61-4f85-ab98-27b5beed3bab" label="lyrics-like">in córde</l><l xml:id="m-fa68b76d-f3fc-4ac2-9382-dbd8f26ce3c6" facs="#m-f95bb5c3-53f0-45e2-94b3-544f5149be4c" label="lyrics-like">ipsí- us. T. P. Alle-lú¬ia</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
